Hi,

I have posted the first version of the agenda for the OpenPrinting Meeting:

https://www.linux-foundation.org/en/OpenPrinting/LFSummitAustin2008

There are still some TBDs, but two joint meetings are already set, with 
the Desktop Architects and Driver Backports workgroups. There will also 
be a joint meeting with the LSB group, which will most probably happen 
in the morning.

The open 45 minutes in the afternoon we can use for a final discussion 
after the joint meetings.

Suggestions for further sessions are welcome.

I am also working on setting up the possibility of call-in participation.

